    "detailed_description": "<h1>Join our Discord</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2964810/extras/b129017df8139f693d969d00568d2a6c.poster.avif?t=1734651129\" width=602 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2964810/extras/b129017df8139f693d969d00568d2a6c.webm?t=1734651129\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2964810/extras/b129017df8139f693d969d00568d2a6c.mp4?t=1734651129\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the seductive and perilous world of &quot;Revenge of Black Bone,&quot; the eagerly awaited sequel to the smash hit game &quot;Curse of Black Bone.&quot; Set sail once more for the sun-kissed shores of Port Royal, where treasures gleam, mysteries whisper, and beautiful women captivate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2964810/extras/933ee8648ddde1be73c64e320a62101f.avif?t=1734651129\" width=602 height=108 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this mature, open-world RPG, you'll immerse yourself in a Caribbean teeming with danger and desire. Navigate the treacherous waters of piracy and passion as you embark on an epic nautical adventure filled with intrigue, betrayal, and, of course, plenty of sensual encounters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2964810/extras/eec9f6fcd704ab458378e8b20a087cac.poster.avif?t=1734651129\" width=602 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2964810/extras/eec9f6fcd704ab458378e8b20a087cac.webm?t=1734651129\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2964810/extras/eec9f6fcd704ab458378e8b20a087cac.mp4?t=1734651129\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the vibrant streets and shadowy alleys of Port Royal, where every corner holds a new secret to uncover and every tavern brims with tales of daring exploits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2964810/extras/4d7343d648c3f875778ffdb735fe049d.avif?t=1734651129\" width=602 height=108 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in high-stakes encounters with dangerous pirates and cunning rivals, or indulge in steamy liaisons with the town's alluring inhabitants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2964810/extras/f3e78fc12f81d3129f69f3dda563ac88.poster.avif?t=1734651129\" width=602 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2964810/extras/f3e78fc12f81d3129f69f3dda563ac88.webm?t=1734651129\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2964810/extras/f3e78fc12f81d3129f69f3dda563ac88.mp4?t=1734651129\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring stunning high-resolution animation, &quot;Revenge of Black Bone&quot; brings its world to life in breathtaking detail, from the shimmering waves of the Caribbean Sea to the intimate moments shared behind closed doors. With a vast 3D world to explore and an abundance of collectible treasures to discover, every journey promises excitement and intrigue.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2964810/extras/0788eb763bc4712ce16d8fd7728ee673.poster.avif?t=1734651129\" width=602 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2964810/extras/0788eb763bc4712ce16d8fd7728ee673.webm?t=1734651129\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2964810/extras/0788eb763bc4712ce16d8fd7728ee673.mp4?t=1734651129\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So hoist the sails, raise the anchor, and prepare to chart your course through a world of adventure and temptation in &quot;Revenge of Black Bone.&quot; Your destiny awaits on the shores of Port Royal.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2964810/extras/b129017df8139f693d969d00568d2a6c.poster.avif?t=1734651129\" width=602 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2964810/extras/b129017df8139f693d969d00568d2a6c.webm?t=1734651129\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2964810/extras/b129017df8139f693d969d00568d2a6c.mp4?t=1734651129\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the seductive and perilous world of &quot;Revenge of Black Bone,&quot; the eagerly awaited sequel to the smash hit game &quot;Curse of Black Bone.&quot; Set sail once more for the sun-kissed shores of Port Royal, where treasures gleam, mysteries whisper, and beautiful women captivate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2964810/extras/933ee8648ddde1be73c64e320a62101f.avif?t=1734651129\" width=602 height=108 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this mature, open-world RPG, you'll immerse yourself in a Caribbean teeming with danger and desire. Navigate the treacherous waters of piracy and passion as you embark on an epic nautical adventure filled with intrigue, betrayal, and, of course, plenty of sensual encounters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2964810/extras/eec9f6fcd704ab458378e8b20a087cac.poster.avif?t=1734651129\" width=602 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2964810/extr