/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2964810/extras/0788eb763bc4712ce16d8fd7728ee673.poster.avif?t=1734651129\" width=602 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2964810/extras/0788eb763bc4712ce16d8fd7728ee673.webm?t=1734651129\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2964810/extras/0788eb763bc4712ce16d8fd7728ee673.mp4?t=1734651129\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So hoist the sails, raise the anchor, and prepare to chart your course through a world of adventure and temptation in &quot;Revenge of Black Bone.&quot; Your destiny awaits on the shores of Port Royal.</p>",
